  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "归档对话清理 / Archive Cleaner",
      "text": "一个 DSH Web 插件：只列出**默认工作区**里已归档的对话，逐条勾选后把这些对话从本机彻底删除。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- 左侧栏「归档清理」入口，主面板显示默认工作区的归档对话。\n- 单条勾选、全选、取消全选；「删除选中」带二次确认。\n- 删除范围：\n  - 会话日志目录（含历史格式代）\n  - 会话投影缓存\n  - 工作区归档、置顶、会话归属记录\n  - 该对话派生的子智能体会话日志\n- 仍在内存中的归档对话会先停止并卸载，再删除文件。\n- 删除完成后客户端列表同步移除，不会留下「未分组」幽灵行。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "从 GitHub 安装（把 `web` 换成你的 profile 名）：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:xinzhi-liu/dsh-archive-cleaner-panel\n```\n\n桌面端请在应用内的插件管理里安装同一个 GitHub 地址，然后刷新页面。\n\n安装后左侧栏出现 **「归档清理」**。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用",
      "text": "1. 在侧栏把对话归档。\n2. 打开 **「归档清理」**。\n3. 勾选一个或多个归档对话。\n4. 点击 **「删除选中」**，确认后彻底删除。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安全边界",
      "text": "- 只处理**默认工作区**中**已归档**的对话。\n- Host 端再次校验归档状态和工作区归属，不信任客户端传入的路径。\n- 删除路径必须位于会话存储根目录下，且目录名等于 Session id。\n- 全文搜索索引是派生数据库，会在下一次搜索时自动对账。\n- 删除不可撤销，不进入回收站；工作区里的普通文件不受影响。"
    },
    {
      "section": "要求",
      "text": "- DSH `>=0.2.1-rc.3 <0.3.0`\n- Node.js `>=22`\n- Web profile；依赖 JSONL 会话持久化后端的 `locate()`"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发",
      "text": "```sh"
    },
    {
      "section": "在本机 profile 中 link 此目录",
      "text": "pnpm --dir \"$DSH_PROFILE_DIR\" add link:<绝对路径>\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "section": "Archive Cleaner",
      "text": "A DSH Web plugin that lists archived conversations in the **default workspace** and permanently deletes the selected ones."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Sidebar entry and a panel scoped to the default workspace.\n- Per-row selection, select all, and a destructive action with confirmation.\n- Removes the session log directory, projection cache, workspace archive/accounting records, and subagent session logs derived from the selection.\n- Stops and unloads archived sessions that are still in memory before deleting files.\n- Removes the rows from the Client list so they do not reappear under Ungrouped."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:xinzhi-liu/dsh-archive-cleaner-panel\n```\n\nOn Desktop, install the same GitHub address from the in-app plugin manager, then refresh the page."
    },
    {
      "section": "Safety",
      "text": "- Only archived sessions in the default workspace are accepted.\n- The Host re-checks archive state and workspace membership; client-supplied paths are never trusted.\n- The delete path must sit under the session storage root and its directory name must equal the Session id.\n- Deletion is permanent and does not use a recycle bin. Ordinary workspace files are untouched."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
